Versioned loading and dumping of circuit documents.

Mirrors backend/src/phasor_workbench/serialization/ and must agree with it.
Held to the same fixtures in shared/fixtures/version/, which declare their
expected outcome in a language-neutral form -- see
docs/decisions/ADR0006_VersionCompatibility.md section 5.

Reading a circuit this build did not construct is the first time TypeScript's
compile-time types are insufficient, so the runtime shape validation deferred
by ADR-0005 section 6 is decided here. That decision lands in ADR-0008.

Empty until Milestone 3.
